BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.43 0.45 0.49 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 428.2 Tm (Source: DOM-CVS-0025 | CIRCULATION 1, pp. 79-81) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 405.0 Tm (18. A deep vein in one leg becomes obstructed, increasing pressure in vessels upstream. What local change) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 391.3 Tm (most directly favours swelling?) Tj ET
