BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.43 0.45 0.49 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 187.1 Tm (Source: DOM-CVS-0037 | CIRCULATION 2, pp. 31-36; Regional, pp. 22-23) Tj ET
